WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.472
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:48.112
[APPLAUSE]

00:00:55.590 --> 00:01:01.840
(SINGING) Maybe this
time I'll be lucky.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:04.450
Maybe this time he'll stay.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:17.110
Maybe this time for the first
time love won't hurry away.

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:23.350
He will hold me fast.

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:29.840
I'll be home at last.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.770
Not a loser.

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:38.390
Anymore.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:43.240
Like the last time
and the time before.

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:55.566
Everybody loves a winner
so nobody loved me.

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:01.610
I call singing my
first language.

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:06.770
Our currency is being open
and being open and available

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.580
to our emotions.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.190
If you're closed
off as a person,

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:11.690
how are you going
to be a performer,

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:18.068
to get out there and show love,
or show agony, or show despair?

00:02:18.068 --> 00:02:21.680
(SINGING) Do what I
want without listening.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.480
Listen.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:26.440
Make sure I'm listening to the
person I'm up there on stage

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:28.840
with, because if
you're truly listening,

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.950
then that'll force you
to be in the moment.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.500
(SINGING) You would
die without me.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:37.070
I pray not to let me go.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:47.330
Yes, the strong gets more,
while the weak ones fail.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:59.696
Empty pockets don't ever
make the grade Mama may have,

00:02:59.696 --> 00:03:06.080
Papa may have, but
God bless the child.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.865
Less got his own.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.160
'Cause God is all.

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:20.020
Evolution is very important
to me as an artist.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:23.020
Usually if I'm scared of
it I know I have to do it.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:27.760
I will be a better
actress, a better artist--

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.370
doesn't necessarily mean
that I will succeed,

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:33.940
but will I have
grown as a result?

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:37.180
(SINGING) From this
minute I'm telling you.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:38.934
I keep this vow.

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:40.395
Oh, my Porgy.

00:03:40.395 --> 00:03:42.343
Oh, my Bessy.

00:03:42.343 --> 00:03:46.840
You is my woman now.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:05.190
[APPLAUSE]

